{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 172,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.455078125,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "when implementing the recommendation, the type of evidence and very low certainty on which the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.1812133789062,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "recommendation is based should be made transparent and clearly communicated to patients during",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994898796081543,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.4266967773438,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "the decision-making process. Finally, when considering the implementation of the recommendation,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        522.6373291015625,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "it was highlighted that the unavailability of HCV treatment should not delay MDR/RR-TB treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        137.8345489501953,
        192.092529296875,
        153.49453735351562
      ],
      "text": "Drug–drug interaction",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        160.70252990722656,
        527.530029296875,
        175.14552307128906
      ],
      "text": "Although data on DDIs between newer HCV treatments (DAAs) and MDR-TB medications are limited,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983437538146973,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        173.9025421142578,
        436.34222412109375,
        188.3455352783203
      ],
      "text": "current evidence suggests minimal interactions. However, caution is still advised.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        195.6063995361328,
        527.598388671875,
        210.0493927001953
      ],
      "text": "Bedaquiline, a key component of most MDR-TB regimens, may increase the risk of liver toxicity,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        208.80641174316406,
        527.5156860351562,
        223.24940490722656
      ],
      "text": "particularly when co-administered with some HCV treatments. Additionally, some MDR-TB drugs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        222.0063018798828,
        527.4002075195312,
        236.4492950439453
      ],
      "text": "(e.g. ethionamide/prothionamide and clofazimine) might interact with specific DAAs (daclatasvir) by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.93043518066406,
        443.6297912597656,
        249.64942932128906
      ],
      "text": "(151) affecting how the body processes them, although this has not been proven  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        256.9102783203125,
        527.554931640625,
        271.3533020019531
      ],
      "text": "Owing to these potential interactions, consulting with a specialist is essential. The specialist can",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        270.11029052734375,
        527.4365844726562,
        284.5533142089844
      ],
      "text": "assess individual patient factors and recommend the optimal treatment plan that minimizes DDIs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.0343017578125,
        380.60540771484375,
        297.7533264160156
      ],
      "text": "(140) and maximizes treatment success for both HCV and MDR-TB  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        314.1541748046875,
        212.0641326904297,
        329.8141784667969
      ],
      "text": "Patient-centred approach",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.0220947265625,
        527.3792724609375,
        351.4651184082031
      ],
      "text": "Efforts are required to provide patient support to enable full adherence to treatment. Supporting",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.22210693359375,
        527.3397827148438,
        364.6651306152344
      ],
      "text": "patient adherence may be important to retain patients on treatment even when a regimen is relatively",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.974169731140137,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        363.422119140625,
        527.5414428710938,
        377.8651428222656
      ],
      "text": "short. WHO recommendations on care and support and a related handbook are available through the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.963138580322266,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        375.3460998535156,
        527.5408325195312,
        391.06512451171875
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated guidelines on tuberculosis. Module 4: Treatment – tuberculosis  previously published",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.978679656982422,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        388.5461120605469,
        412.17926025390625,
        404.26513671875
      ],
      "text": "care and support (152)  and in the chapter 3 of this consolidated document.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        417.639404296875,
        223.77130126953125,
        433.49139404296875
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.6993103027344,
        527.4091796875,
        455.142333984375
      ],
      "text": "Patients undergoing treatment for both HCV and MDR/RR-TB require close monitoring throughout",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.8992919921875,
        527.253173828125,
        468.3423156738281
      ],
      "text": "the treatment course. The GDG emphasized the importance of regular clinical assessments and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.09930419921875,
        527.3882446289062,
        481.5423278808594
      ],
      "text": "laboratory testing. The specific schedule of testing will be determined by the health care provider,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.29931640625,
        146.986083984375,
        494.7423400878906
      ],
      "text": "but may include:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        501.8931884765625,
        161.5719451904297,
        516.2481689453125
      ],
      "text": "HCV monitoring",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.9473237991333,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.003173828125,
        78.23609924316406,
        516.4461669921875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        161.5009002685547,
        502.003173828125,
        527.3255004882812,
        516.4461669921875
      ],
      "text": "– this typically involves HCV RNA testing to track viral load and measure treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9473237991333,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        515.2032470703125,
        527.4135131835938,
        529.646240234375
      ],
      "text": "response. An SVR at 12 weeks after the end of treatment indicates a cure. Other tests, including",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        528.4031982421875,
        527.4337158203125,
        542.84619140625
      ],
      "text": "liver function, are also critical to monitor for potential liver damage and have to be observed during",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966750144958496,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        540.3272094726562,
        217.6894989013672,
        556.0462036132812
      ],
      "text": "(153) the course of treatment  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        554.6932373046875,
        184.26406860351562,
        569.0482177734375
      ],
      "text": "MDR-TB monitoring",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.80322265625,
        78.23609924316406,
        569.2462158203125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.27430725097656,
        554.80322265625,
        527.4303588867188,
        569.2462158203125
      ],
      "text": "– the treatment response should be monitored by using monthly sputum",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        568.003173828125,
        527.5360107421875,
        582.4461669921875
      ],
      "text": "and smear microscopy and culture (ideally at the same frequency). The schedule should be similar",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999149322509766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        579.9271850585938,
        512.2993774414062,
        595.6461791992188
      ],
      "text": "(8) to that for bacteriological monitoring recommended for shorter all-oral MDR TB regimens  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        602.9072265625,
        527.399169921875,
        617.3502197265625
      ],
      "text": "Based on guidance in current literature and clinical experience, the panel advised the following with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        616.107177734375,
        527.4244384765625,
        630.5501708984375
      ],
      "text": "regard to monitoring and evaluation of the safety and effectiveness of the co-administration of HCV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.3071899414062,
        225.30389404296875,
        643.7501831054688
      ],
      "text": "and MDR-TB treatment regimens:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        651.0111083984375,
        78.23609924316406,
        665.4541015625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        651.0111083984375,
        527.427734375,
        665.4541015625
      ],
      "text": "implementation of both regimens requires access to both treatments; however, the unavailability",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        664.2111206054688,
        390.20831298828125,
        678.6541137695312
      ],
      "text": "of HCV treatment should not delay the initiation of MDR treatment;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        677.4111328125,
        78.23609924316406,
        691.8541259765625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        677.4111328125,
        527.4970092773438,
        691.8541259765625
      ],
      "text": "programmes need to have access to reliable DST for MDR-TB medicines, bacteriological tests",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        690.611083984375,
        524.4094848632812,
        705.0540771484375
      ],
      "text": "(sputum smear microscopy and culture), and monitoring of the virological response for HCV; and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.8110961914062,
        78.23609924316406,
        718.2540893554688
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        703.8110961914062,
        527.5464477539062,
        718.2540893554688
      ],
      "text": "although the data assessed did not unearth any major signals of risk, aDSM systems must be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        717.0111083984375,
        527.41455078125,
        731.4541015625
      ],
      "text": "functional to conduct rigorous active monitoring of adverse events and promptly detect, manage",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        730.2111206054688,
        312.3723449707031,
        744.6541137695312
      ],
      "text": "and report suspected or confirmed drug toxicities.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "158 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}